                <mxCell id="schema-notes" value="Keys and constraints&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Underlined attributes form the primary key.&lt;br&gt;PK(registrations) = (member_id, meeting_id).&lt;br&gt;FK = foreign key; UQ = unique attribute.&lt;br&gt;UNIQUE offline_rooms(address, place).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHECK meetings.capacity &gt; 0.&lt;br&gt;CHECK meetings / events: end_at &gt; start_at.&lt;br&gt;events requires at least one room; both are allowed.&lt;br&gt;EXCLUDE: events in the same room cannot overlap.&lt;br&gt;Periods use [start_at, end_at).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Relationship labels show maximum counts;&lt;br&gt;0..1 marks an optional room reference.&lt;br&gt;FK deletion rule: NO ACTION." style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
